[Original discussion](https://github.com/PrestaShop/PrestaShop/pull/25353#issuecomment-2186840234)

### Steps to reproduce

1. Create an order as a guest with email "abc@abc.com" and stay on the OrderConfirmation page
  > order_id: 1, customer_id: 1
2. In the second window make another guest order with the same email address and open GuestTracking for the that (second) order
  > order_id: 2, customer_id: 2
3. In window with GuestTracking, transform guest into customer with password "aaa"
4. In window with OrderConfirmation, transform guest into customer with password "zzz"
5. Only customer with id=1 can log into account, another is basically blocked

